# package-lock.json is TRACKED, deliberately. It was ignored from the initial
# commit -- a sensible default for a library, wrong for a shipped
# application. Mission Control is packaged as a portable .exe and handed to
# a launch team, so the exact dependency tree that was tested is the one
# that must ship. `npm ci` also REQUIRES it, and CI could not install
# without it.
